<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for September 30 to October 6 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	    Sept 30-Oct 6   Oct 2-8	   TOTAL	    TOTAL</p>
<p>		   1996	 1995		1996	     1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    367,204.1   240,063.7</p>
<p> Production	29,371.5    39,807.8    510,054.3   324,932.0</p>
<p> Shipment	   6,048.6    32,750.8     285,296.1  226,599.0</p>
<p> Home Market	  309.8	 495.8	 3,988.8    5,758.3</p>
<p> Stocks/close   390,217.2   246,624.9</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
